  "finalText": "Root probably has a fixed height, clipping the new section. Checking.\nI added a testimonials section after the features. It has a \"Loved by product teams\" heading and three quote cards. Each card has the quote, a round grey avatar placeholder, the person's name and their company. The cards use the same surface fill, 16px radius and 24px padding as the feature cards, and the fonts follow the page's tokens. The render looks right.\n\nThe three cards are all the same height here because their quotes wrap to two lines. If you edit a quote to a different length, the cards will no longer match. The vertical \"fill\" sizing I first used collapsed the cards, so I set them to hug their content instead.\n\nThe names, companies and quotes are placeholders I wrote, so swap in real ones.",
